  "description": "Beer Distribution Game rebuilt from Tom Fiddaman's native RB4-S13-NoSS-6.mdl (2018 author download). Restores all four inventories/backlogs, two shipping stages, order-slip queues, supply-line accounting and rounded anchor-and-adjust order policy. Native desired stocks17/12, stock correction0.26, supply-line weight0.34 and forecast adjustment0.25 are explicit; initial supply lines16/12 replace the incomplete8-case extraction. Original model ID, existing element IDs/positions, demand step at week5 and 52-week horizon are retained; native model ends at36. This is the deterministic default policy, not all human decision presets or stochastic-noise experiments. A discrete_period of1week fixes the source recurrence; fractional timesteps and non-Euler methods are rejected.",
